{{also|ভালো}}
==Assamese==

===Etymology===
{{inh+|as|inc-oas|ভাল}}, from {{inh|as|pra-mag|𑀪𑀮𑁆𑀮}}, from {{inh|as|sa|भल्ल|ভল্ল|auspicious}}.<ref>{{R:CDIAL|bhalla|9408}}</ref> Cognate with {{cog|rkt|ভাল|tr=bhal}}, {{cog|syl|ꠜꠣꠟꠣ}}, {{cog|bn|ভাল|tr=bhalo}}, {{w|Hindustani language|Hindustani}} {{m|ur|بھلا}} / {{m|hi|भला}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{as-IPA}}

===Adjective===
{{as-adj}}

# [[good]]
#: {{ant|as|বেয়া}}

====Derived terms====
{{col2|as|ভালকৈ|ভালে|ভালেই|ভালেমান|ভালে-ভালে|ভাল কৰা|ভাল হোৱা}}

===References===
{{reflist}}

==Bengali==

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|bn|pra-mag|𑀪𑀮𑁆𑀮}}, from {{inh|bn|sa|भल्ल||happy, fortunate, auspicious}}, from earlier {{m|sa|*भद्ल|tr=*bhadlá}}, from {{inh|bn|iir-pro|*bʰadrás|*bʰadrás ~ *bʰadlás}}, from {{inh|bn|ine-pro||*bʰn̥d-lós}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*bʰend-||to be happy}}. {{dbt|bn|ভদ্র|ভাদ্র|ভন্দিষ্ঠ}}.

====Alternative forms====
*{{alt|bn|ভালো}}
*{{alt|bn|ভালা}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|bn|/bʱalo/|[ˈbʱaloˑ]|[ˈbʱaːloˑ]}}
* {{IPA|bn|/bʱal/|[ˈbʱal]}} {{q|colloquial, when followed by another /l/}}
* {{rhymes|bn|alo|s=2}}
* {{hyphenation|bn|ভা|ল}}

====Noun====
{{bn-noun|tr=bhalo}}

# [[good]], [[goodness]]
#: {{ant|bn|মন্দ}}
#: {{ux|bn|[[সুখ|সুখে]] [[থাকা|থেক]], '''ভাল''' [[থাকা|থেক]], [[মন|মনে]] [[রাখা|রেখ]] [[এই]] [[আমি|আমারে]]।|Stay happy, stay well, and remember me.|lit=Stay in happiness, stay in '''goodness''', and keep me in your mind.|tr=śukhe theko, '''bhalo''' theko, mone rekho ei amare.}}

=====Inflection=====
{{bn-ndecl-v-inan|bhalo}}

====Adjective====
{{bn-adj|tr=bhalo}}

# [[good]]
#: {{ant|bn|খারাপ|বাজে|মন্দ}}
#: {{ux|bn|এই খাবারটা খুব '''ভাল'''।|This food is very '''good'''.|subst=ভাল/ভালো}}

====Adverb====
{{bn-adverb|tr=bhalo}}

# [[well]]
#: {{ant|bn|খারাপ|বাজে}}
#: {{ux|bn|আমি '''ভাল''' বাংলা বলতে পারি না।|I can't speak Bengali '''well'''.|subst=ভাল/ভালো}}

===Etymology 2===
{{lbor|bn|sa|भाल}}.

====Pronunciation====
*{{IPA|bn|/bʱal/|[ˈbʱal]}}

====Noun====
{{bn-noun}}

# [[forehead]], [[brow]]
#: {{syn|bn|কপাল|ললাট}}
# {{lb|bn|figuratively}} [[destiny]], [[fate]]
#: {{syn|bn|কপাল|ললাট|ভাগ্য|নিয়তি}}
#: {{ux|bn|[[হাসি]]-[[কান্না]], [[হীরা]]-[[পান্না]] [[দোলা|দোলে]] '''ভালে'''।|Laughter and lament, and diamonds and emeralds sway in the game of '''fate'''.|footer=–{{w|Rabindranath Tagore}}}}

==Early Assamese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|inc-oas|pra-mag|𑀪𑀮𑁆𑀮}}, from {{inh|inc-oas|sa|भल्ल|ভল্ল|t=auspicious}}.

===Adjective===
{{head|inc-oas|adjective}}

# [[good]], [[well]]
#: {{ux|inc-oas|[[প্ৰথমতে]] [[ভৰত]][[-অক|ক]] [[ভেট|ভেটিবাক]] [[যা|যাওঁ]] ।<br>'''ভাল''' [[মতে]] [[তান]] [[চিত্ত]] [[জিজ্ঞাস|জিজ্ঞাসিয়া]] [[চাহ|চাওঁ]] ॥|At first I go to obstruct [[Bharata]],<br>then I ask about the tune and mind '''proper'''ly.}}

====Descendants====
* {{desc|as|ভাল}}
